{"title":"Career Roadmap: Offshore Engineer","role":"Offshore Engineer","summary":"An Offshore Engineer works on engineering systems and operations associated with offshore facilities such as offshore oil & gas platforms, FPSOs, offshore support facilities, subsea infrastructure and offshore energy installations.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"Marine Engineering"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build expertise in marine systems, offshore equipment, mechanical systems, safety, maintenance and offshore operations"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An Offshore Engineer works on engineering systems and operations associated with offshore facilities such as offshore oil & gas platforms, FPSOs, offshore support facilities, subsea infrastructure and offshore energy installations."},{"type":"p","text":"For a Marine Engineering graduate, the strongest pathway is to combine marine machinery + mechanical systems + offshore operations + maintenance + safety + reliability."},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"“Offshore Engineer” is a broad industry title. The exact role may be mechanical, marine, structural, subsea, electrical, instrumentation, drilling, production or maintenance engineering. A Marine Engineering graduate is particularly aligned with marine machinery, rotating equipment, maintenance, utilities and offshore mechanical systems."}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof to Create","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"1st Year"},{"text":"Engineering fundamentals"},{"text":"Mathematics, physics, mechanics"},{"text":"Engineering fundamentals projects"},{"text":"Weak mathematics/physics"}],[{"text":"2nd Year"},{"text":"Marine engineering fundamentals"},{"text":"Thermodynamics, fluid mechanics, marine machinery"},{"text":"Machinery analysis"},{"text":"Memorizing without understanding"}],[{"text":"3rd Year"},{"text":"Offshore systems + maintenance"},{"text":"Pumps, compressors, turbines, hydraulics, reliability"},{"text":"Equipment maintenance project"},{"text":"No practical equipment exposure"}],[{"text":"4th Year"},{"text":"Offshore operations + safety"},{"text":"HSE, reliability, offshore standards, digital tools"},{"text":"Offshore engineering capstone + internship"},{"text":"Graduating without field exposure"}]]}]},{"heading":"Semester-by-Semester Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Semesters 1–2 — Engineering Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engineering mathematics"},{"text":"Engineering physics"},{"text":"Engineering chemistry"},{"text":"Engineering mechanics"},{"text":"Electrical fundamentals"},{"text":"Engineering drawing"},{"text":"Computer programming"},{"text":"Basic thermodynamics"},{"text":"Technical communication"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build fundamentals in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mechanics"},{"text":"Energy systems"},{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Fluid behaviour"},{"text":"Mechanical systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semesters 3–4 — Marine Engineering Core"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Thermodynamics"},{"text":"Fluid mechanics"},{"text":"Heat transfer"},{"text":"Strength of materials"},{"text":"Machine design"},{"text":"Marine engineering systems"},{"text":"Marine diesel engines"},{"text":"Steam and gas turbines"},{"text":"Boilers"},{"text":"Pumps"},{"text":"Compressors"},{"text":"Heat exchangers"},{"text":"Refrigeration"},{"text":"Marine electrical systems"},{"text":"Hydraulic and pneumatic systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Fuel","Engine","Power","Propulsion / Machinery","Auxiliary Systems"]},{"type":"h","text":"Semesters 5–6 — Offshore Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Offshore platforms"},{"text":"FPSO systems"},{"text":"Offshore support vessels"},{"text":"Offshore production facilities"},{"text":"Power generation"},{"text":"Process utilities"},{"text":"Pumps and compressors"},{"text":"Piping systems"},{"text":"HVAC"},{"text":"Fire and gas systems"},{"text":"Water treatment"},{"text":"Fuel systems"},{"text":"Ballast systems"},{"text":"Cargo systems"},{"text":"Emergency systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Preventive maintenance"},{"text":"Predictive maintenance"},{"text":"Condition monitoring"},{"text":"Reliability engineering"},{"text":"Failure analysis"},{"text":"Root-cause analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semesters 7–8 — Professional Offshore Preparation"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Offshore operations"},{"text":"HSE"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"Permit-to-work systems"},{"text":"Emergency response"},{"text":"Maintenance planning"},{"text":"Asset management"},{"text":"Offshore logistics"},{"text":"Technical documentation"},{"text":"Digital monitoring"},{"text":"Internship"},{"text":"Final-year project"}]}]},{"heading":"Core Technical Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Marine Machinery"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Marine diesel engines"},{"text":"Gas turbines"},{"text":"Steam turbines"},{"text":"Boilers"},{"text":"Generators"},{"text":"Pumps"},{"text":"Compressors"},{"text":"Heat exchangers"},{"text":"Separators"},{"text":"Purifiers"},{"text":"Freshwater generators"},{"text":"Refrigeration systems"},{"text":"Hydraulic systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Operation"},{"text":"Performance"},{"text":"Troubleshooting"},{"text":"Maintenance"},{"text":"Failure modes"},{"text":"Energy efficiency"}]}]},{"heading":"Offshore Systems","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","